  "name": "Phanaeng Curry Paste - SD Books",
  "text": "Phanaeng Curry Paste - SD Books\n\nYield: ½ cup + 1 tbsp\n\nPreparation Time:\n\nCooking time:\n\nIngredients\n\n5 dried spur chilies (seeded and soaked until tender),\n\n1 tsp sea salt,\n\n1 tsp mature galangal (finely sliced),\n\n½ tbsp kaffir lime rind (finely sliced),\n\n1 tsp coriander root (finely sliced),\n\n1 tsp lemongrass (sliced),\n\n10 gloves small garlic (sliced),\n\n⅓ cup shallot (sliced),\n\n½ tsp pepper,\n\n1 tsp shrimp paste.\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Process to a smooth paste.",
